---
import SectionWrapper from '../ui/SectionWrapper.astro';
---
<SectionWrapper background="light" class="our-work-section our-work-stories-section">
  <section id="stories" class="container container-wide our-work-content" aria-labelledby="stories-title">
    <header class="our-work-section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">EXPLORE THE WORK</p>
        <h2 id="stories-title">A closer look at the work.</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Every collection needs a way in. This guide introduces the five volumes and helps you move from the big picture into the initiatives, conversations, and moments behind the work.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="our-work-reader-guide" aria-label="A guide to the Our Work collection">
      <div class="our-work-reader-guide-intro">
        <p class="our-work-reader-guide-kicker">A READER'S GUIDE</p>
        <span class="our-work-reader-guide-mark" aria-hidden="true">E / D</span>
        <h3>Start with a question. Follow the work.</h3>
        <p>This collection is arranged by the kind of work being done—not by a timeline or a list of announcements. Begin with any chapter to explore the context, people, and moments behind it.</p>
        <div class="our-work-reader-guide-foot"><span>OUR WORK</span><span>FIELD NOTES &amp; RECORDS</span></div>
      </div>

      <nav class="our-work-reader-guide-index" aria-label="Explore the five volumes">
        <a class="our-work-reader-guide-entry" href="#initiatives">
          <span class="our-work-reader-guide-number">01</span>
          <span class="our-work-reader-guide-entry-copy"><small>INITIATIVES</small><strong>Taking ideas into real learning environments.</strong><span>Explore the initiatives</span></span>
          <span class="our-work-reader-guide-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
        <a class="our-work-reader-guide-entry" href="#partnerships">
          <span class="our-work-reader-guide-number">02</span>
          <span class="our-work-reader-guide-entry-copy"><small>PARTNERSHIPS</small><strong>Building progress through shared effort.</strong><span>Explore the partnerships</span></span>
          <span class="our-work-reader-guide-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
        <a class="our-work-reader-guide-entry" href="#forums-events">
          <span class="our-work-reader-guide-number">03</span>
          <span class="our-work-reader-guide-entry-copy"><small>FORUMS &amp; EVENTS</small><strong>Making space for the future of learning.</strong><span>Explore the forums and events</span></span>
          <span class="our-work-reader-guide-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
        <a class="our-work-reader-guide-entry" href="#in-the-field">
          <span class="our-work-reader-guide-number">04</span>
          <span class="our-work-reader-guide-entry-copy"><small>IN THE FIELD</small><strong>Taking ideas beyond the page.</strong><span>Explore field engagements</span></span>
          <span class="our-work-reader-guide-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
        <a class="our-work-reader-guide-entry" href="#recognition">
          <span class="our-work-reader-guide-number">05</span>
          <span class="our-work-reader-guide-entry-copy"><small>RECOGNITION &amp; FEATURES</small><strong>Keeping a record of the work in public.</strong><span>Explore recognition and features</span></span>
          <span class="our-work-reader-guide-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </section>
</SectionWrapper>
